<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0'>
  <meta name='robots' content='noindex'>
  <title>MindMeister - 404</title>
  <link href='/static.css' media='screen, projection' rel='stylesheet'>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='ui-wrapper flex-wrapper w-900'>
    <div class='flex-content'>
      <div class='ui-content-head ui-centered'>
        <img src='/images/404-error.svg' class='ui-icon'/>

        <div class='h1-text'><h1 class='header-title'>Page not found.</h1></div>
      </div>

      <div class='ui-content-body ui-centered flex-wrapper'>
        <p>
          We alerted the sniffer dogs, sent a search team, and filed a report with Interpol. But we still couldn’t find that page. Check if you entered the correct URL and try again, or go back to the homepage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='ui-content-body ui-centered'>
        <a href='/' class='button large default home'>
          Take me home <img src='/images/arrow.svg' class='right-arrow-icon'>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
